# Config for the Playwright suite's mocked dev server (`npm run dev:mock`, i.e. `vite --mode
# mock`) - see testing-strategy.md's "Integration tests against a mocked API" section. No secrets,
# no real infrastructure: VITE_GRAPHQL_API_URL is a same-origin path MSW intercepts (see
# src/testSupport/mocks/), and VITE_COGNITO_* aren't needed at all in this mode since
# vite.config.ts aliases auth/cognito.ts to auth/cognito.mock.ts, which never constructs a real
# CognitoUserPool.
#
# VITE_DEMO_USER_EMAIL/PASSWORD must match cognito.mock.ts's DEMO_USER record exactly - they're
# what HomePage pre-fills into the signed-out sign-in form (see README.md's Home page section),
# and what calendar-menu.spec.ts's "once personId resolves" tests sign in with.
VITE_GRAPHQL_API_URL=/graphql
VITE_DEMO_USER_EMAIL=demo@example.com
VITE_DEMO_USER_PASSWORD=Demo-password-1
